{"asset_key":"mn2/env_story_10360250","episode":"mn2","category":"env_story","story_id":"10360250","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1036025001:1":{"text":"ああ、ずっと洞窟の出口を探してたんだ。","source_cn":"没错，我一直在寻找可以离开洞穴的出口。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x286C73559BE1D915","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1036025002:1":{"text":"洞窟の中は比較的安全だが、それでも一時的なものだ。","source_cn":"虽然呆在洞穴里面还算安全，但你也知道，这一切只是暂时的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D70EA32B02F45FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1036025003:1":{"text":"いくつか出口を見つけたが、どこも蛍光花がいるんだ。","source_cn":"我找了不少洞口，可我找到的每个出口外都有荧荧花。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DDC0A3175D1BA39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1036025004:1":{"text":"ああ、鹿霊様……この蛍光花たちはいったいどこから現れたんだ？","source_cn":"鹿灵在上……到底是从哪冒出来这么多荧荧花？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x656C5406015B2F46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民塞米":{"text":"村人のサイミー","source":"村民塞米","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}